      "apiDescription": "## Props\n\n```\nexport type BadgeProps = {\n  /**\n   * @description badge type.\n   * @default 'danger'\n   */\n  type?: BadgeType;\n  /** @description if a little dot is displayed. */\n  isDot?: boolean;\n  /** @description hidden badge. */\n  hidden?: boolean;\n  /**\n   * @description display value.\n   * @default ''\n   */\n  value?: string | number;\n  /**\n   * @description maximum value, shows `{max}+` when exceeded. Only works if value is a number.\n   * @default 99\n   */\n  max?: number;\n  /**\n   * @description whether to show badge when value is zero.\n   * @default true\n   */\n  showZero?: boolean;\n  /**\n   * @description CSS style of badge\n   * @default {}\n   */\n  badgeStyle?: StyleValue;\n  /**\n   * @description set offset of the badge\n   * @default [0, 0]\n   */\n  offset?: [number, number];\n  /** @description customize dot background color */\n  color?: string;\n  /** @description custom class name of badge */\n  badgeClass?: string;\n}\n```\n\n## Events\n\n```\nexport type BadgeEvents = {\n  /** triggers when the bound value changes */\n  change: any[];\n  \"visible-change\": any[];\n  \"remove-tag\": any[];\n  clear: any[];\n  blur: any[];\n  focus: any[];\n}\n```\n\n## Slots\n\nEach slot is typed with the props it passes to its content.\n\n```\nexport type BadgeSlots = {\n  default: {};\n  content: { value: unknown };\n}\n```\n\n## Exposed\n\nAvailable on the component instance through a template ref.\n\n```\nexport type BadgeExposed = {\n  ns: NamespaceHelpers;\n  content: string;\n  contentClasses: (string | undefined)[];\n  contentStyle: (string | false | CSSProperties | StyleValue[])[];\n}\n```",
